    "turn_text": "Marshall here. Welcome back to the realignment. Hey everyone. Welcome back to the show. Today's guest is Massachusetts Congressman Jake Auchincloss before getting into politics. Jake was a Marine officer and like many young politicians, so many 36 years old, he is thinking about what the future looks like in a realigning America. In this conversation, we cover a bunch of topics, everything from the realignment of the media ecosystem in what the rise of podcasting means for politicians moving forward to, of course, everything from the abundance agenda to inflation, debts, deficits, and where young men fit into this evolving landscape. Hope you all enjoy the conversation and a huge thank you to the Foundation for American Innovation for supporting the work of this podcast. Representative Jake Ockencloss, welcome to the realignment.",
