    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "do Democrats reach young men? Conversation is going to get old very, very quickly, but we still got two to three weeks outside of the election results to do it, giving your biography, giving the fact that you were a Marine officer. I'd be very curious, obviously, to buy a graphical level. you're just sort of the go-to person of like how can we have a democratic party that increasingly struggles to speak to masculine young men like what's just your take at both like a meta level and then like a prescriptive level on that whole conversation.",
