      },
      {
        "text": "There is no shortcut to building political understanding or influence.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Personal experience gained from door-knocking and face-to-face conversations is valuable.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Democrats have taken on a defensive posture when discussing policy.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Effective communication requires engaging across diverse platforms including podcasts, Twitch, town halls, and direct mail.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Focusing solely on cable news and press conferences limits outreach effectiveness.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Attempts to meaningfully discuss policy at a high level have not been effective.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Young voters, both men and women, consume large volumes of online content across formats.",
        "confidence": 0.87
