    "turn_text": "How do you do that effectively? Because you and I are like foreign policy guys are very interested in that. And I think back to earlier this summer, you had NATO at the big summit bring in all these like content creators. So you had Tony P at the NATO summit. You had content creators and tech doctors all over the Democratic National Convention this summer. I get in the literal why that falls into the category of like showing up, leaning into new media, but I didn't seem to be particularly effective from my perspective. I don't think Tony P doing viral videos in his suit about NATO was like an effective thing. So I just curious how you thought about like that, like implementation of direction, what you're talking about.",
